{"agent":"bg96","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The regression never queues. `_hold` replaces `SL.hold` with a context manager that returns immediately and ignores `*a/**k`, and only stubs `time.monotonic` with two canned samples. `runner.run(..., timeout_s=7200)` then asserts `_execute` was handed 7200. That stays green for the recorded failure: another lane holds the suite lock for ~3000s and `gate run … ci --timeout 3000` returns `ci: UNAVAILABLE - timed out after 3000s`, and also if `run` still passes that timeout into `hold` as the wait cap. The sibling `test_the_run_timeout_does_not_override_the_suite_wait` only inspects a direct `_run_locked` call, so a `run()` path that still spends `--timeout` on the queue is untested. The \"queued 20s / 7300s\" story is not an input the tests execute.","digest":"bcbf8f1cc1754467","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_ci_suite_slot_cost.py:test_a_queued_suite_run_keeps_its_full_run_budget","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_ci_suite_slot_cost.py:test_a_queued_suite_run_keeps_its_full_run_budget"}],"chunks_total":2,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":15047,"diff_sha":"ed2c08cab544e59f739bfa5221385d016d6e81e3cca261cd01f20730f2f54905","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B4f35548c0a","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":83.7,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"85e1f9753917b8a3","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B4f35548c0a.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261108T211442Z-07dd3669.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794172482.8637185,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_id":"6f3b72578280","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed